{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1968, the once prosperous company town of Cerro Milagroso vanished in a single week. The official story said that a fire had destroyed most of its infrastructure, along with all but one of the town's 724 residents, but you don't buy it. There's a bigger story that lies beneath, and you will be the one to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/ff947aea3434bf6aef4ee25978940324.poster.avif?t=1761769326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/ff947aea3434bf6aef4ee25978940324.webm?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/ff947aea3434bf6aef4ee25978940324.mp4?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non-linear detective game rooted in Latin American history that allows you to enter a world of memories and deduce secrets beyond your wildest imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/5f55035f3ed49ee3dbb4ba1d0e42d992.poster.avif?t=1761769326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/5f55035f3ed49ee3dbb4ba1d0e42d992.webm?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/5f55035f3ed49ee3dbb4ba1d0e42d992.mp4?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL DETECTIVE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, discover and deduce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/8d1adb57be394fa3ab856006cb59156a.poster.avif?t=1761769326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/8d1adb57be394fa3ab856006cb59156a.webm?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/8d1adb57be394fa3ab856006cb59156a.mp4?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/dd04734ff58c1a55a41e5308803f9be4.poster.avif?t=1761769326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/dd04734ff58c1a55a41e5308803f9be4.webm?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/dd04734ff58c1a55a41e5308803f9be4.mp4?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a complex web of environments, and scour them for clues and hidden information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore past events first-hand and piece together a timeline of events.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down secret relationships, family lineages and causes of death in your journal. Discover secret identities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is a liar until proven otherwise, use deductive reasoning to determine what really happened.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 10\u201312-hour experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MAGICAL REALIST EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/727d042ee8dcb7fd2c1c4d66f1ca2b42.poster.avif?t=1761769326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/727d042ee8dcb7fd2c1c4d66f1ca2b42.webm?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/727d042ee8dcb7fd2c1c4d66f1ca2b42.mp4?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story deeply rooted in Latin American tradition and folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shines a light on real world histories of rebellion and resistance against colonial oppression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses gameplay to demonstrate the often nuanced and fraught relationships between official history, journalism, oral traditions and real events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/909126074fdce606b733c9093454ee1b.poster.avif?t=1761769326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/909126074fdce606b733c9093454ee1b.webm?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088360/extras/909126074fdce606b733c9093454ee1b.mp4?t=1761769326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMETHING SLUMBERS UNDERNEATH THE TOWN</h2>","background"